{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 3. Proof that the 0.00070 gap between d* \u215 ? ln(10) and Omega is a known correction term or is exactly zero.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 4. Explicit bijection or isomorphism between epsilon_k spectrum and t_k spectrum.\par}
